This product is a Rust port of LangExtract (https://github.com/google/langextract),
Copyright 2025 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The tokenizer, chunking, prompting, format handling, resolver/alignment and
visualization modules in crates/extract-core, and the provider clients in
crates/extract-providers, are adapted from the corresponding LangExtract
Python modules. They were rewritten in Rust and modified; the changes are
listed in README.md ("What's different from the original").

